### FusionIsExist Platform API Example Requests
@host = http://localhost:8000
@token = YOUR_JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Health Probe
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login & Authenticate
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Database Connection
POST {{host}}/api/database-connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Production Postgres",
  "database_type": "postgresql",
  "host": "postgres",
  "port": 5432,
  "database_name": "platform_db",
  "username": "postgres",
  "password": "postgres",
  "ssl_enabled": false
}

### 5. Test Database Connection
POST {{host}}/api/database-connections/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Introspect & Sync Database Schema
POST {{host}}/api/database-connections/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/sync-schema
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Upload Knowledge Document
POST {{host}}/api/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_policy.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Company Remote Work Policy: Employees are entitled to 20 days of paid vacation annually.
--WebAppBoundary--

### 8. Create Knowledge Base
POST {{host}}/api/knowledge-bases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Company Policies",
  "description": "HR and remote work guidelines"
}

### 9. Create Conversation Session
POST {{host}}/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "SQL Analytics Session"
}

### 10. Synchronous Chat Request (Database / RAG / Hybrid)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How many users are registered in the database?",
  "conversation_id": null
}

### 11. Streaming SSE Chat Request
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Summarize the PTO vacation policy",
  "conversation_id": null
}

### 12. Get Message Citations
GET {{host}}/api/messages/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/citations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Get Message SQL Trace
GET {{host}}/api/messages/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/sql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
